        <briefdescription>
<para>Checks if an event is in a specific category. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function checks whether the provided EventCategory is set within the categories that are currently active. The comparison is done by bitwise AND operation with GetCategoryFlags() and Category.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Category</parametername>
