<parameterdescription>
<para>- The category to check against. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>True if the event is in the specified category, false otherwise.</para>
</simplesect>
Checks if an event is in a specific category.</para>
<para>This function checks whether the given EventCategory (bitmask) is set within the result of GetCategoryFlags(). It uses bitwise AND operation to compare the Category flag with all flags.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
