    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for an event. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is the abstract base class that represents a generic event in the system. It provides methods to get information about the type of the event, its category flags and whether it has been handled or not.</para>
<para>Represents an event in the system.</para>
<para>This class represents a generic event that can be handled by various components of the system. It provides methods to get information about the type, category and name of the event. The ToString method returns the name of the event as default implementation but subclasses may override it with more meaningful representation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
